WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.346
- Do you guys want to hear
more about Toronto Dance Salsa?

00:00:06.855 --> 00:00:08.626
So, I got a recent comment
from one of you guys

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:11.143
in Believe Nation from Alex, who said

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.532
Evan, would you make a video
talking about your experience

00:00:13.532 --> 00:00:16.248
with Toronto Dance Salsa
or a regular series.

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.553
And, so I'm curious from
you guys, would you want

00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:22.510
a regular series about
what I'm doing with TDS?

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.046
It'd be a little bit harder to
orchestrate and make happen,

00:00:25.046 --> 00:00:26.566
but I'm curious to figure out,

00:00:26.566 --> 00:00:28.804
is it something that you guy want to do&gt;

00:00:28.804 --> 00:00:31.335
Now, I try to bring up stories
that I think are relevant

00:00:31.335 --> 00:00:34.839
when I'm doing an espresso,
or any of my opinion pieces,

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:36.756
I always bring in stories that I think

00:00:36.756 --> 00:00:38.116
would be relevant to the topic,

00:00:38.116 --> 00:00:40.011
and often that'll include
whatever I'm doing

00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:41.674
at Toronto Dance Salsa or
something that's happened

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.647
in the past week or couple weeks

00:00:43.647 --> 00:00:46.515
to try to inject a little bit more context

00:00:46.515 --> 00:00:48.896
into how I'm thinking
and what I've learned,

00:00:48.896 --> 00:00:51.344
and how I'm applying it to my businesses.

00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:53.416
But it sounds like that's a
little different that this,

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:56.476
which is a series just focusing on TDS,

00:00:56.476 --> 00:00:58.083
why we're here, what we're doing,

00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:59.901
how we're growing it, what the vision is,

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.452
maybe involving some of my team at TDS,

00:01:02.452 --> 00:01:06.188
so, I'm curious, is it
something you're interested in?

00:01:06.188 --> 00:01:08.502
Pros and cons, let me know what you think,

00:01:08.502 --> 00:01:10.697
and if there's specific requests

00:01:10.697 --> 00:01:13.793
that you want to see, if
it's a yes, what's probably

00:01:13.793 --> 00:01:15.176
going to happen is what we normally do,

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:16.505
we'll do one test video.

00:01:16.505 --> 00:01:19.291
It'll be a test video, and
we'll see what you guys think,

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:20.618
and then we'll take action from there.

00:01:20.618 --> 00:01:23.009
So, is it what you want to see?

00:01:23.009 --> 00:01:25.656
And then, give me specific requests

00:01:25.656 --> 00:01:30.304
for what you'd want to see
in that first test video.

00:01:30.304 --> 00:01:31.652
If that works, we might continue,

00:01:31.652 --> 00:01:34.235
if it doesn't work, then we're
probably going to cancel it.

00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:35.068
We'll see.

00:01:35.068 --> 00:01:35.901
So, let me know.

00:01:35.901 --> 00:01:37.454
Make it great, what would a great

00:01:37.454 --> 00:01:39.083
first video look like for you?

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:40.798
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:01:40.798 --> 00:01:42.538
And, if you don't like the idea at all,

00:01:42.538 --> 00:01:43.891
leave it in the comments below, too.

00:01:43.891 --> 00:01:44.943
And we'll see what happens.

00:01:44.943 --> 00:01:46.265
Thank you for the suggestion Alex.

00:01:46.265 --> 00:01:47.771
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:48.815
I believe in you.

00:01:48.815 --> 00:01:50.630
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.759
and whatever your one word is.

00:01:52.759 --> 00:01:54.676
Much love, see ya soon.

